sword training from her father when she lived in the mansion deep in the forest of the royal capital, Salem."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to her father's missing, she is currently working at a cafe so as to pay off the debt."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she doesn't know much about the world and clumsy, she always holds a positive attitude towards everything with all her might."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Not doubting other people, she encounters dangers from time to time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89933"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永羽が異世界に迷い込んだ際に最初に出会った少女で、永羽の事を気遣い色々と世話をしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"英雄の血を引く名家・ラインスタッド家の娘で、王都セイレムの森の奥に佇む屋敷で暮らしていた時は、父親から剣技の手ほどきを受けていた。現在はその父親が失踪した影響で没落し、借金返済のためカフェで働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずで不器用だが、何事にも常に前向きで一生懸命。人を疑う事をしない為、度々危ない目に遭う。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22510","sourceWorkId":"29478","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"永羽が異世界に迷い込んだ際に最初に出会った少女で、永羽の事を気遣い色々と世話をしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"英雄の血を引く名家・ラインスタッド家の娘で、王都セイレムの森の奥に佇む屋敷で暮らしていた時は、父親から剣技の手ほどきを受けていた。現在はその父親が失踪した影響で没落し、借金返済のためカフェで働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずで不器用だが、何事にも常に前向きで一生懸命。人を疑う事をしない為、度々危ない目に遭う。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76837"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76837","value":"猫、１ポン貯金、つまみ食い"},{"label":"苦手なもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76837","value":"算数、帳簿付け"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a02c34a3d64e71ccdd369953448e9c861896eee9a94ed35ce57f533d6845b91.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/223077c5af2de8354181ce1d6f371c522e3c2a48a427e256d2c713e5e91c814e.webp","width":174,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:304735:76837:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c89934","characterName":"ルー=ベルフレア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"76838","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"304735"},{"characterId":"76838","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"347348"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22511"],"vndbCharacterId":"c89934"},"originalCharacterName":"ルー=ベルフレア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the daughter of a nobleman in Zeil Kingdom, which has been hostile to Yugudora Kingdom for many years. She met with Towa and his friends when she came to Yugudora as an international student."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since black is regarded as a holy color in Zeil Kingdom, she is completely dressed in black, but it's thought to be an odd appearance in Salem, though."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her family is so wealthy that she has a strange money sense, tending to solve everything with money."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89934"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ユグドラ・キングダムとは長年敵国だったムーア王国の貴族の娘で、留学生としてユグドラ・キングダムにやってきた際に永羽達と知り合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒が神聖な色だとされるムーア王国らしく、全身黒色の衣装を纏っており、王都セイレムでは変わった格好として見られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家が超がつく程お金持ちだった為に金銭感覚がおかしく、なんでもお金で解決しがち。喧嘩っ早い性格で、争いがあると好んで突っ込んでいく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22511","sourceWorkId":"29478","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ユグドラ・キングダムとは長年敵国だったムーア王国の貴族の娘で、留学生としてユグドラ・キングダムにやってきた際に永羽達と知り合う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒が神聖な色だとされるムーア王国らしく、全身黒色の衣装を纏っており、王都セイレムでは変わった格好として見られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家が超がつく程お金持ちだった為に金銭感覚がおかしく、なんでもお金で解決しがち。喧嘩っ早い性格で、争いがあると好んで突っ込んでいく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76838"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76838","value":"永羽が持参したお菓子、恋愛小説"},{"label":"苦手なもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76838","value":"魚の目玉、可愛いもの"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cad5dd3012aa866e5e1f780bdb367fc19783645fe00e9f28fcf3719b26da5d4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fad18807227d492c075b112439651b3931ab1f079a94f8e4f3833209ae623bd.webp","width":174,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鹿瀬紫卯","creatorId":"vndb:s8642","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8642","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8642","name":"鹿瀬紫卯","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:304735:76838:56841:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c89935","characterName":"立花 八雲","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"76839","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"304735"},{"characterId":"76839","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"347348"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22512"],"vndbCharacterId":"c89935"},"originalCharacterName":"立花 八雲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a girl with black hair from the remote, far east. When Yugudora Kingdom expanded further east, a state of war developed in the region, and she, whose hometown had been destroyed, came to the royal capital for a certain reason."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her skill of sword reaches a genius level, which can be demonstrated completely even in the \"Clarias\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mysterious as she is, she often feels hungry and patronizes the cafe where Shelly works."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89935"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"遥か極東からやってきた黒髪の少女。ユグドラ・キングダムが極東にも勢力を伸ばしたことで戦争状態となり、故郷を滅ぼされた彼女はある理由で王都を訪れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣の腕は天才的であり、その実力は鎧でもいかんなく発揮される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はサバサバとしているが、時折血も涙もない事を悪びれもせず話す事がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"謎の多い人物であるが、よく腹を空かせており、シェリーが働くカフェに通い詰める事になる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22512","sourceWorkId":"29478","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"遥か極東からやってきた黒髪の少女。ユグドラ・キングダムが極東にも勢力を伸ばしたことで戦争状態となり、故郷を滅ぼされた彼女はある理由で王都を訪れた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣の腕は天才的であり、その実力は鎧（クラリアス）でもいかんなく発揮される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はサバサバとしているが、時折血も涙もない事を悪びれもせず話す事がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"謎の多い人物であるが、よく腹を空かせており、シェリーが働くカフェに通い詰める事になる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76839"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76839","value":"焼きそばパン、水浴び"},{"label":"苦手なもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76839","value":"屋内"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/578ef7fe607067be542e9905485fc24456d86b0fb1ef0147a797e5d1fbe9907e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d042ae471237c3aaf5e35880c0c0b01ce30eba2b88d74397f4710c747a1489db.webp","width":174,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空賀花","creatorId":"vndb:s15476","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15476","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15476","name":"空賀 花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:304735:76839:34089:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c89936","characterName":"カミュ=ホームズ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"76840","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"304735"},{"characterId":"76840","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"347348"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22513"],"vndbCharacterId":"c89936"},"originalCharacterName":"カミュ=ホームズ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a detective girl who looks like a boy, using \"boku\" to call herself. In fact, Towa thinks she is a boy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Entrust by the police, she has solved various difficult cases with her exceptional reasoning ability. Because Towa, a suspicious oriental person from a different world, was thought to be the criminal of a case, she became hostile to Towa and his friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn't trust people basically. Therefore, she doesn’t rely on other people, preferring to act alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89936"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"男の子のような容姿をしている探偵少女。自分の事をボクと言うのもあり、現に永羽は彼女を男の子だと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"警察から依頼され、類まれなる推理力によって様々な難事件を解決している。ある事件の犯人が、異世界からきた怪しい東洋人、永羽だと考えた事で、永羽達と敵対する事となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に人を信用していない。その為人に頼るという事ができず、単独行動を好む。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22513","sourceWorkId":"29478","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"男の子のような容姿をしている探偵少女。自分の事をボクと言うのもあり、現に永羽は彼女を男の子だと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"警察から依頼され、類まれなる推理力によって様々な難事件を解決している。ある事件の犯人が、異世界からきた怪しい東洋人、永羽だと考えた事で、永羽達と敵対する事となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に人を信用していない。その為人に頼るという事ができず、単独行動を好む。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76840"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76840","value":"読書、昼寝、プリン"},{"label":"苦手なもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"76840","value":"医者"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6f1d0034786da848a40accc6855a5ecd3bcc43502bc31c5c990ef3b5bc5918c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9e95839ebb324be73b1a6dd5b23d9e91a0986a15766acc38f2cd37de3e32caac.webp","width":174,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤沢れい香","creatorId":"vndb:s14338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14338","name":"藤沢 れい香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:304735:76840:32998:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c89937","characterName":"長井 永羽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c89937"},"originalCharacterName":"長井 永羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Finding a mysterious egg during the school trip, he was taken to a different world. Although he is unwilling to fight in a strange armor in that world, he can basically control it thanks to his previous fighting experience."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is trying to find a way to return to his original world step by step with his either originally optimistic attitude or the thought that nature will take its course."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is also concerned about his young sister Hirose, who used to live with him, but now is left alone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89937"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2add9dbb91635fe4dd701df3d8138f20d4bfda3969a29cd86aa9deba951f62f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/823588da8dbe901aed69a4c78cf071bc70c670d0b405